  "solution": "Concept used:\n\na% of b = a over 100 × b\n\nCalculation:\n\n10% of A + 8% of B = ((3)/(5)) (12% of A + 16% of B)\n\n⇒ [((10A)/(100)) + ((8B)/(100))] = ((3)/(5)) [((12A)/(100)) + ((16B)/(100))]\n\n⇒ (10A + 8B) = ((3)/(5)) (12A + 16B)\n\n⇒ (10A + 8B) × 5 = 3 × (12A +16B)\n\n⇒ 50A + 40B = 36A + 48B\n\n⇒ 50A – 36A = 48B – 40B\n\n⇒ 14A = 8B\n\n⇒ A/B = 8/14\n\n⇒ A : B = 8 : 14 = 4 : 7\n\n∴ The ration of A : B is 4 : 7.\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/f13e2ad6582c16aa62a83672e2547ad20a01fddb61962a1acce42eb9a1a99caa.png] **__Additional Information__**10% = 10/100\n\n8% = 8/100\n\n12% = 12/100\n\n16% = 16/100",
